ing-and-help/opportunity-management/&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Opportunity Management&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://salescrm.intel.com/training-and-help/pipeline-management/&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Pipeline Management&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://salescrm.intel.com/training-and-help/reporting/&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Reporting&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://saleskpi.intel.com/&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Sales KPI Resources&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://salescrm.intel.com/whats-new-2/&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;What’s New in Sales CRM&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</value>
